      {
        "author_name": "Carl Belanger",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/110539693034594070486/reviews",
        "language": "en-US",
        "original_language": "fr",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocJYS9nOyGJi7GGua10-JnJvTODFpNlzMTli4TyD0K6MiaFhoQ=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo",
        "rating": 1,
        "relative_time_description": "6 years ago",
        "text": "Well, I was referred to this place by someone in the family... My first meeting with Andre Poirier, no problem, I give him my documents from me and my partner, I leave, they tell me that they will contact me again and that the price would be $250 (a little expensive but I was told they are pros so let go) after 1 full week he calls me and asks me to look for missing documents. I send him the documents, another week asks me for other documents (not able to ask me everything at the same time and quickly..) after 3 weeks they call me and ask me to come and sign documents to send them, it's the month of August so I'm one of the people who do their taxes, right? I go there, Mr. Poirier isn't there, his son asks me for $350 + taxes AYOYE!? I pay, sign and I leave. Accountants like that are ready to go when they do taxes. He predicts $712.30 in reimbursement to the provincial government, I receive $77 and $181.47 to the federal government, I receive $0, I pay $&@#! . In my assessment notice, they explain the corrections that were made. He took RRSPs that I never invested and gave me an unemployment amount, and I have not been on unemployment in the last 10 years. I strongly advise against this place. If I could have given it a 0 out of 5, I would have done it. I could have done my taxes myself, all crooked on the computer, and the government would have corrected it, if you understand what I mean. Really unprofessional, made me run everywhere for papers. $350, much too expensive for nothing. I will spread the word on all social networks and to those around me, be sure of it! I have publicly posted the photos of my assessment notice and their prediction in the photo tab.",
        "time": 1570051132,
        "translated": true
      },
      {
        "author_name": "Eliane Levesque",
